        <li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g3Z8VnARbQg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Why visual analogies fail</a><span>For complex concepts, and what would work instead</span></li>
        <li><a href="/concept-bubbles/">What are concept bubbles?</a><span>The definition, and what the technique is not</span></li>
